            "review_title": "Review at Kerala Palace Authentic Indian Restaurant",
            "review_text": "dalexUSA\nCharlotte, North Carolina11 contributions\n0\nTasty, affordable Indian food in Nha Trang\nFeb 2025 • Solo\nA tasty, complete meal (with papadam and rice pudding) for $8.00 USD or LESS. (Mine was 150,000 VND, $6.00 USD equivalent.) It's a homey little place down an alley (and left), off the main road. It's not much for atmosphere, but the food more than compensates. The papadams (complimentary) were fresh and crisp, and the chutneys not too strong to have more than a few bites. The chairs are hard, but the service is attentive and friendly. My vegetable curry lacked some of the spicy zing I'm accustomed to, but it could be a regional difference. It was still hot and tasty, with the perfectly cooked basmati rice that I also ordered. I look forward to trying the samosas and dosas. You will be hard pressed to find a better value in Indian food.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 27, 2025",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
