            "review_text": "michellebrown2000\nLondon, United Kingdom112 contributions\n0\nWe Love Curry\nFeb 2025 • Couples\nIf you love Indian food this is the place for you, we have been to 2 other Indian restaurants in Nha Trang and this one is by FAR the best, its a little out of town and down a side street but it does have a sign showing you the way which was really helpful so make the effort and go. The food was delicious and really tased good. The menu is great and food came well presented, we had masala popadoms to start, garlic chicken, a prawn dish, egg biriyani, chana masala and a garlic nan for mains, we were given 2 popadoms with a great home made mango chutney and some rice pudding as extras which was a lovely touch. The waiter was a really attentive and the chef came out after cooking which was lovely. I highly recommend this restaurant and we will return before we leave Nha Trang as we really love curry! Please go and support this great restaurant.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nThe food is not over the top spicy so if you like it hot just ask.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 7, 2025",
