            "review_text": "terminator6645\nLinz, Austria34 contributions\n0\nAmazing! super flavoury and authentic south indian restaurant\nJan 2025 • Family\nFor everyone who likes indian food this is a must in nha trang \n\nFirst i was not sure as its not in the center located but its totally worth it!\n\nMost of the indian restaurants serve north indian dishes. This one is focused on the southern indian food. As southern Region is known for their spices you will definetly taste that in their dishes. Its super authentic and very flavoury!! and the best part for those who are concered like me about which oil the use for cooking. they use sunfloweroil!\n\nThey just opened a few months ago.\nHere some pictures of the dishes we had the last 2 weeks ✌️\nRead more\nWritten January 18, 2025",
